# Best chart — always (ISZE)

Jerome, 2026-09-16: always think and do the best chart for the job.

**Full map + method:** skill `isze-best-chart` → `.cursor/skills/isze-best-chart/SKILL.md`  
**Design brief:** `01_data/90_INBOX/_kpi_graph_design_proposal.md`

## Instant fails

- Slope / bump with more than ~6 labelled series (small markets overlapping = FAIL)
- Pie/donut comparing many distributors or many families
- Every chart the same horizontal bar
- Chart title that is only a section name, not the business question
- Overlapping labels “fixed” by shrinking type — change the form or split the panel
- Gap shown without euro + family + fleet (see `isze-gaps-need-context.mdc`)

## Instant defaults

- Rank / who wins → ranked bars + reference
- Mix inside one DB × one family → donut ≤4 segments
- Fleet direction → slope for top fleets only; change bars for the rest
- Dropdown = question or parts family, not a raw chart-type picker

When building or reviewing any chart in `02_dashboards/`, meeting packs, or KPI lab work: load and follow `isze-best-chart`.
